module mistake_leindex .
rem run: at [1,2,3] 2
rem trap: at [1,2,3] 3

fn at input xs slice u8 . input i u64 . output u8 .
  rem ko: ✘ `le` 는 `i = len xs` 를 허락한다 --- 그 칸은 한 칸 밖이다 /// en: ✘ `le` allows `i = len xs` --- that slot is one past the end
  requires le i. len xs. . . .
do
  return idx xs. i. . .
end .
